        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Giibeedeayda Yerusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba gweaydeaba shageash ea sheedeaba damanamughuush, bea sugoocheanduumeeda Sedekiya sugoocheanda Yuda. Hean ghwahidu Nebukadinesa was sugoocheanda Babeli sea lugoadaanyi sean gang'uchi sea Yerusalemu ak gwaneaweesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gweaydeaba damwanagi bea sugoocheanduumeeda Sedekiya bea sheedeaba ang'wan eaweedeaba shageash bea sheeda, hean geenyarja meatkweenagi bea ghamarda mujiini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gaweay gah, fuga hees sean bea sugoocheanda Babeli ak goobiitpiit aba dooshta mida bugusta: was Nergal-sharesa, Samgar-nebo, Sarsekimu bea Rabsari, Nergal-sharesa bea Rabmagi, sea fuga hees sean bea sugoocheanda Babeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak Sedekiya was sugoocheanda Yuda, ea lugoadaanyi sean hean daah saawa, geawapta ak geeriteawa mujiini eawa, nea geesik naweeda boostaaneeda sugoocheanda ak geesik dooshta mida bugusta ghamar iyeenya ak geeweay meatkweeda Araba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwaat geeshta nyaawa lugooda fuga Galdayo, iidu geanyasa Sedekiya mooheeda Yeriko ak geang'waay, ak geayaat heeda Nebukadinesa was sugoocheanda Babeli, aba Ribla mida ng'eanyiida Hamati, ak goorgweaksa niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwanuuseada sugoocheanda Babeli orjooga Sedekiya aba madeadaanyi; aba hoowa bea Riblaan, ak gabiikta sugoocheanda Babeli gwanuuseada fuga hees sean bea Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea mabeachi nih iidu gwanyarjeawi gheanyanga Sedekiya ak gwarada aba biingu ak ghwaat Babeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fuga Galdayo iidu ghaghwarda gheeda sugoocheanda ea gealga buuneeda, nea geenyarja ghamarda Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean Nebusaradani, was shirikarajeanda haw ambal furiischoodiga ghoang'waay easanga buuneeda ghayi abit aba mujiini ak ghwaat Babeli, ea fuga ghayi was easanga nung'wa heeda mujiini ak gaweay gaguuy sea niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu Nebusaradani was shirikarajeanda haw ambal furiischoodiga ghwanung'wa ng'eanyiida Yuda fiisu ng'ay barbari mandeawana gil, ak ghoadaw madameega sabiibu ea heechea eabwar aba damandida.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeremiya geetina ghealooniga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goobalool Nebukadinesa was sugoocheanda Babeli Nebusaradani was shirikarajeanda haw ambal furiischoodiga aba badayda Yeremiya nea gwayeesha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aada Yeremiya ak ging'ulayi muuchi, nea adisimi ng'asheanda muy, sinda gidagasiida niny.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebusaradani was shirikarajeanda haw ambal furiischoodiga, ea Nebu-shasbani bea Rasbari, ea Nergal-sharesa, siida haw ambal fuga nala searoojiga miinga ea shirikarajeega hees sean bea sugoocheanda Babeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "geecheakta buuneeda ak geang'aamwa Yeremiya doodooda furiischoodiga, ak geayiin geatinga Gedaliya orjeeda Ahikamu was orjeeda Shafani, ak ghwaat gheanyi hean goobiida bugusta buuneeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Rarooda Ebedmeleki",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gawa ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA heeda Yeremiya, damandida mideewa ghealoonigean nea gwanda jeeda doodooda furiischoodiga ak gwayeesha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Asi una ak giibalooli Ebedmeleki was siida Gushi, ak giyeeshi, “Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA bea lugweega, was ASEETA Israeli; ‘Ng'ula, gaydanung' gwasa ng'asheega ghayi eargu aba badaydeaba mujiineani, nea mii ng'asheega miyaasiin gil, gea munyasi, ak ng'asheesu gaygwasa nea ging'ulayi aba gheanyangaagu eaweecheanji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak eaweecheanji gaydanung' ghuha, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA, ak ea majeayiinyi geatinga fugiga iiwaliin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba aba huumwa gaydalealneey ak ea majeabwarnyi aba ng'ucheeda gaynyasa nyageadayda jea aghuuha eaweagaagu aba gideaba nimwaschaani. Gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
